 "notes": "Fan: a canopy arch ending in a curl at the right, with a flatter inner rim under it; the band between holds a triple ring cluster at the left end, a double ring, two outlined triangles each enclosing a ring, a lone ring, and a ring on a forked stem next to a pair of stacked rings. Six ribs hang from the rim at increasing lean, ending in a tilted diamond, a ring, two tilted squares and a ring over a square; a lower rail runs diagonally from the left ring cluster across them to a ring at the right, with a ring on a stem and a second curl hanging below it; a small lattice of cells sits between the two rightmost ribs."
